  "final_message": "Done. Summary of the build:\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`, stdlib `sqlite3` + Flask/werkzeug only \u2014 `requirements.lock` unchanged)\n- SQLite DB at `./data/quiz.db` (repo-root relative \u2192 `/app/data` in the container), seeded on first start with 24 general-knowledge questions; idempotent, worker-race safe.\n- Auth: `POST /api/auth/register` (201, 409 on taken name), `POST /api/auth/login` (200 `{\"token\": ...}`), Bearer tokens in the `tokens` table; protected routes answer 401. The `admin` account is created at startup with `ADMIN_PASSWORD`; when the variable is unset/empty admin sign-in answers 403 and registration of `admin` is blocked. No built-in password.\n- `GET /api/quiz?count=n` \u2014 random active questions, never includes `correct_option`.\n- `POST /api/attempts` \u2014 validates answers (400 with messages), returns the attempt (`id`, `score` %, `correct`, `total_questions`, `submitted_at`, `answers` with question fields + `correct_option` + `selected` + `is_correct`); persisted only when signed in (201 either way, `id: null` for visitors).\n- `GET /api/attempts` (newest first) and `GET /api/attempts/{id}` \u2014 own attempts only, others get 404.\n- `POST /api/admin/questions` (201, validation via `{\"error\": ...}`) and `GET /api/admin/questions?page&page_size` \u2192 `{items, total, page, page_size}`, admin-only (401/403).\n- `GET /api/health` and SPA serving of `frontend/dist` with history fallback.\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/`, React 19 + TS + Vite 8 + Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`, single `src/index.css` entry, no hand-written CSS)\n- Register/sign-in forms showing API errors, signed-in username + Sign out.\n- Quiz: one question at a time, radio options, \"Question 2 of 5\" + progress bar, Next / Submit (Previous allowed), result view with score, \"X of Y correct\", per-question review marking chosen and correct options, and the \"Sign in to save your results\" prompt for visitors.\n- My attempts list (date, score, question count) \u2192 attempt review; admin page with Add-question form surfacing API validation messages plus a paginated question list with correct options.\n\n**Verified** with a 61-check suite against the real gunicorn server (fresh DB: 61/0), covering auth, quiz secrecy, scoring, isolation, admin validation/pagination, disabled-admin mode, restart persistence, and SPA serving; every frontend view was render-checked and `tsc --noEmit` + `npm run build` pass.",
  "final_message_truncated": false,
